# Runtime receipts — 내구성 계약(CLAUDE.md):
#   plan/implement receipt = 세션 진단용 → working-tree only
#   ship receipt(mccp-pr-codex) = 감사 대조 corpus → git-tracked
# 2026-07-22: 부트스트랩 미검토 기본값(mccp-bootstrap.plan.md §11 Q3,
# commit 375157d) 대체. 그 기본값이 감사 자체를 불가능하게 만들었다(E1).
.claude/receipts/*
!.claude/receipts/mccp-pr-codex/
.claude/receipts/mccp-pr-codex/*.lock
.claude/receipts/mccp-pr-codex/*.tmp

# v0.2 Stop-loop bounded counter and advisory locks (session-local).
# STATE.md and fix-task.md remain git-tracked per plan §4.
.claude/state/loop-counter.json
# v1.22.1 live-activation M1 — session-keyed cumulative worker-launch counter
# (orchestration-runaway.js). Same class as loop-counter.json above; its .lock
# sibling is caught by the *.lock glob but the .json body needs its own entry.
.claude/state/orchestration-runaway.json
# 위 카운터의 **형제 디렉토리**(orchestration-runaway.js#getDebtDir가 카운터 경로에
# '.debt'를 덧붙인다)라 위 항목도 `.claude/state/*.lock` glob도 닿지 않는다. 같은
# 축의 세션 로컬 상태이고, 의미 자체가 "이 세션의 controller가 fan-out 도중 죽었다"라
# 커밋하면 모든 clone에 유령 headroom이 고정된다.
.claude/state/orchestration-runaway.json.debt/
# santa-loop-materialize M1 — 라운드 원장 본문 (santa/ledger.js). UI9: 본문은
# gitignored로 두고 집계값만 receipt에 봉인한다(봉인은 M2 소유). 라운드마다의
# diff 노이즈 없이 계측 분모는 살아 있다. loop-counter.json ·
# orchestration-runaway.json과 같은 축이며, 디렉토리 단위 항목이라 형제
# `<slug>.json.lock` · `<slug>.json.<pid>.<rand>.tmp`도 함께 덮는다.
.claude/state/santa-loop/
.claude/state/*.lock
# dashboard-truthfulness M1 — completion-ledger entries ARE git-tracked, but the
# per-entry write lock + atomic tmp are local-only ephemera. The single-level
# glob above does not reach this subdir, so name them explicitly to keep
# crash-leaked locks/tmps out of the tracked register directory.
.claude/state/completion-ledger/*.lock
.claude/state/completion-ledger/*.tmp
# multi-session-work-loop M3 — work-unit occupancy registry (evidence-claim.js).
# Session-local by construction: a claim binds {session_id, host, session_pid} of
# a LIVE session, so committing one would resurrect a dead holder in every clone
# and make the fence reject legitimate writers. Registered BEFORE the artifacts
# exist (Task 1 precedes Task 4) so there is no window in which a claim file can
# be staged by accident. Directory-level entry also covers the per-slug
# `<slug>.json.lock` and `<slug>.json.<pid>.<rand>.tmp` siblings.
.claude/state/evidence-claims/
# session-process-reclaim M1+M2 — long-lived process registry (session-processes.js).
# Working-tree only by construction: a record binds {pid, host, session_id,
# proc_started_at_ms} of a LIVE process on THIS machine, so committing one would
# hand every clone a stale PID that the SessionEnd reclaim path would then treat
# as a kill candidate. Records also carry `exec_path` as an ABSOLUTE path (§D15
# identity matching needs the full string — normalizing it would make the compare
# structurally always fail), so this entry is the control that keeps worktree
# paths out of the tracked corpus. Registered BEFORE the registry can exist
# (Task 1's first edit) so there is no window in which a record lands tracked.
# Rollback: `rm -rf .claude/state/session-processes/`.
.claude/state/session-processes/
# multi-session-work-loop M5 — state truth-source journal (append-only records +
# rotated segments + checkpoint + degraded marker).
#
# Working-tree only, deliberately (명시 잔여 1). STATE.md stays git-tracked so a
# worktree reset or a pair handoff keeps its context (§3.2), and a fresh clone
# bootstraps the journal FROM that STATE.md as a genesis checkpoint. Committing
# the journal instead would make a per-session-append JSONL a conflict surface in
# every PR — the same judgement §3.12 made when it tracked only ship receipts.
# The cost is stated, not hidden: what crosses a clone boundary is still a summary.
#
# Ignoring it also stops `/mccp:pr`'s PR-phase mutations finalizer from reporting
# `content-changed-during-subphase` on every run: the log is appended to while a
# session runs and the detector reads `git status --porcelain`, so it was flagging
# a review-only invariant "breach" that no edit caused.
.claude/state/journal/
# Codex stop-loop bridge scratch input — local-only.
.claude/state/codex-stop-loop-input.txt
# Dogfood ephemera (fixtures + sandboxes) — never committed.
.claude/state/dogfood-*/
# v0.2.7 hook-trace shard ledgers (per-invocation observability — local only).
# `**/` because a hook run whose cwd is a nested package writes its shards under
# that package's own .claude/ — a root-anchored pattern misses those, and one
# escaped into plugins/mccp/ (see ec57467). Long shard filenames also break
# `git worktree add` under a deep prefix on Windows.
**/.claude/state/hook-trace/
# v0.2.7 hook capability probe cache (per-machine binary path + mtime — local only).
.claude/state/hook-caps.json
# v0.3.0 auto-handoff append-only log (per-session cost-tier events — local only).
.claude/state/auto-handoff-log.jsonl

# Local env
.env
.env.local

# Local Claude Code overrides (per-machine env vars, force-override reasons, etc.)
.claude/settings.local.json

# External seed (ECC fork checkout — reference only, not part of mccp scope)
ECC/

# Git worktrees — multi-session dogfood / verification trees (working-tree only).
# Each worktree has its own branch + .claude/ ledger. Never committed from main.
.worktrees/

# v1.4.0-m3 friction telemetry sidecar — worktree-local M3 metric producer
# (banner-injected event count). Cycle-end aggregation only; never committed.
.claude/state/m3-friction-events.jsonl

# v1.3.0 Observability Surface II — derive cache (M1+, never committed).
# Cache layer is per-session/per-machine; sources of truth remain receipts,
# envelopes, and STATE.md. Pattern mirrors .claude/state/*.lock above.
.claude/cache/

# impeccable Skill plan-stage critique artifacts (user-local tool 산출,
# finding은 plan/code/PR body absorption note로 audit trail 처리).
# Pattern mirrors ECC/ above — 사용자 개별 설치 tool의 작업 부산물.
# 단, config.json은 팀 공유 커밋 대상이라 예외로 둔다 — impeccable 자체
# reference/hooks.md가 per-developer override와 설치 동의 값은 gitignored
# config.local.json에 산다고 명시하므로 config.json에는 비밀이 없다.
# design.json은 detector가 다시 만드는 생성 sidecar라 나머지와 같은 부산물이다.
.impeccable/*
!.impeccable/config.json

# work-context-isolation M1 — dispatch envelope IPC state. Written by
# /mccp:work Step 3 single-worker delegation (dispatch-cli.js prepare-single).
# Per-session working-tree-only IPC between controller + worker; never committed
# (sources of truth remain receipts + STATE.md). Mirrors .claude/state/*.lock.
.claude/state/dispatches/

# diverse-agent-review M1 — /mccp:plan L2 review-panel working artifacts
# (mode/l1/l2/l3/decision/proof/reservation). Per-invocation IPC between the
# command body's fenced blocks; the DURABLE record is .claude/reviews/
# plan-review-<slug>.md plus the receipt's review_proof. Mirrors
# .claude/state/dispatches/ above — and lives under the repo root (not
# .git/mccp/tmp) so review_proof.dispatch_evidence can cite it repo-relatively.
.claude/state/plan-review/

# v1.5.0-m1 — session-ledger repo opt-in scope. Default is global
# (~/.local/share/ecc-homunculus/projects/<projectId>/.session-ledgers/),
# but MCCP_SESSION_LEDGER_SCOPE=repo or hybrid writes here too. Per-session
# JSON files are never appropriate to commit.
.claude/state/session-ledgers/

# v1.4.0 axis B (M2) — ultracode delegation sidecar journal.
# Per-task delegation ledger (NDJSON, append-only) accompanying each plan file
# during /mccp:prp-implement Phase 3.5. Working-tree only audit (F4 absorption).
# Plan body remains committable; delegation history is local per-machine.
*.delegations.jsonl

# multi-session-work-loop M2 — 관측 계측 sidecar (CL-1, santa R1: sidecar 생성 전 등록).
# msw-events append-only event log(per-session .jsonl) + SessionStart env-snapshot
# + SessionEnd handoff-items(세션 id·미완 항목명 — PR-Codex F1: 이것도 per-session
# 로컬 런타임 아티팩트라 커밋 시 세션 상태 유출 + stale 시 baseline 오염).
# 셋 다 per-session working-tree only(원자 append/capture). 커밋 오염 + 이력 유출 방지
# (hook-trace/·session-ledgers/·dispatches/ 패턴 mirror). 미등록 시 raw 이벤트·비밀
# 섞인 토글 값이 git 이력에 유출 → sidecar 파일이 생기기 전에 등록해야 함.
.claude/state/msw-events/
.claude/state/*.env-snapshot.json
.claude/state/*.handoff-items.json

# setup-gitignore M1 — gitignore-provision.js 자신의 부산물. advisory lock 과
# atomic tmp 는 정상 종료 시 사라지지만 크래시하면 남고, `--force-update` 의
# `.bak` 은 설계상 존속하며 실행 직전 파일의 축자 사본이다. 런타임 산출물을
# git 밖에 두는 것이 목적인 도구가 자기 산출물만 예외로 둘 수는 없다.
.gitignore.lock
.gitignore.bak
.gitignore.*.tmp

# gate-guard-integrity M3 (C1) — 저장소 트리 안 test fixture 재발 안전망.
# msw-events.test.js / toggle-snapshot.test.js 의 fixture 는 os.tmpdir() 로
# 이전했으므로 이 패턴은 평시에 아무것도 잡지 않는다. 목적은 같은 형태가 다시
# 유입될 때 커밋 오염을 막는 것 — 이전 고정 경로 2곳은 .gitignore 밖이라
# 실행 잔여물이 트리에 남았고 동시 실행 시 서로 간섭했다.
plugins/mccp/scripts/.test-*/
